            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/fb310defb4529011c13dd8e7c050cea0.avif?t=1791918125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras_big/fb310defb4529011c13dd8e7c050cea0.webp?t=1791918125 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Fairytale</strong> is a turn-based Japanese-style RPG series set in a dying underground world ruled by an evil empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of '90s JRPGs, the series blends classic design with modern visuals and quality-of-life features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1</strong> is the start of the adventure. Play as Haru and his childhood friend Kuroko as they fight a dark empire in the underground 'Lower City'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/268bb9bc4de4d213062c8beb538f7d1c.poster.avif?t=1791918125\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/268bb9bc4de4d213062c8beb538f7d1c.webm?t=1791918125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/268bb9bc4de4d213062c8beb538f7d1c.mp4?t=1791918125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/ff09b2f73cdaf1e0eadafcaaf5210403.avif?t=1791918125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras_big/ff09b2f73cdaf1e0eadafcaaf5210403.avif?t=1791918125 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based battles directly on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern real-time 3D visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute chibi-style characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted anime cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, French, and Japanese support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-wide and stereoscopic 3D support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/d72cb3cbb5572444bf8f872af25a2467.avif?t=1791918125\" width=616 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haru</strong><br>A bit lazy and a lot naive, Haru nonetheless is a kind soul and knows how to handle himself if push comes to shove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/5eb4f69e92a07c4bcae1474625ae49f4.avif?t=1791918125\" width=616 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kuroko</strong><br>She might be short and cute (sometimes), but don't let that fool you: Kuroko is exceedingly capable in battle and always willing to step up. She's also fond of technology - maaaybe a bit too much so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/eb4599eb0dac3545d562cfe0de42215f.avif?t=1791918125\" width=616 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the 'Light Fairytale' series</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode is a standalone game. Episode 1 offers 3 to 6 hours of gameplay at normal difficulty and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionally, import your clear save from previous episodes to carry over stats, items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/187e5ed2036b94e703a72c3c585ee02f.avif?t=1791918125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras_big/187e5ed2036b94e703a72c3c585ee02f.webp?t=1791918125 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/fb310defb4529011c13dd8e7c050cea0.avif?t=1791918125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras_big/fb310defb4529011c13dd8e7c050cea0.webp?t=1791918125 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Fairytale</strong> is a turn-based Japanese-style RPG series set in a dying underground world ruled by an evil empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of '90s JRPGs, the series blends classic design with modern visuals and quality-of-life features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1</strong> is the start of the adventure. Play as Haru and his childhood friend Kuroko as they fight a dark empire in the underground 'Lower City'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/268bb9bc4de4d213062c8beb538f7d1c.poster.avif?t=1791918125\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/268bb9bc4de4d213062c8beb538f7d1c.webm?t=1791918125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/268bb9bc4de4d213062c8beb538f7d1c.mp4?t=1791918125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/ff09b2f73cdaf1e0eadafcaaf5210403.avif?t=1791918125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras_big/ff09b2f73cdaf1e0eadafcaaf5210403.avif?t=1791918125 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based battles directly on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern real-time 3D visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute chibi-style characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted anime cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, French, and Japanese support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-wide and stereoscopic 3D support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/d72cb3cbb5572444bf8f872af25a2467.avif?t=1791918125\" width=616 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haru</strong><br>A bit lazy and a lot naive, Haru nonetheless is a kind soul and knows how to handle himself if push comes to shove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/5eb4f69e92a07c4bcae1474625ae49f4.avif?t=1791918125\" width=616 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kuroko</strong><br>She might be short and cute (sometimes), but don't let that fool you: Kuroko is exceedingly capable in battle and always willing to step up. She's also fond of technology - maaaybe a bit too much so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/eb4599eb0dac3545d562cfe0de42215f.avif?t=1791918125\" width=616 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the 'Light Fairytale' series</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode is a standalone game. Episode 1 offers 3 to 6 hours of gameplay at normal difficulty and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionally, import your clear save from previous episodes to carry over stats, items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras/187e5ed2036b94e703a72c3c585ee02f.avif?t=1791918125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539330/extras_big/187e5ed2036b94e703a72c3c585ee02f.webp?t=1791918125 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
